Package: onboardd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: flavorplus <jmavermeulen@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: network-manager, dnsmasq-base, avahi-daemon, nftables, init-system-helpers
Homepage: https://github.com/flavorplus/onboardd
Description: network onboarding daemon for headless Linux appliances
 onboardd provides Wi-Fi provisioning, a captive setup portal, persistent
 standalone access-point operation, and recovery for product appliances.
